WEBVTT

00:01:58.796 --> 00:02:00.596
The end of poverty,

00:02:00.596 --> 00:02:02.236
a peaceful world,

00:02:02.236 --> 00:02:03.796
a healthy planet.

00:02:04.316 --> 00:02:08.356
But how do you climb
an unscalable mountain

00:02:08.396 --> 00:02:10.556
one step after another?

00:02:10.876 --> 00:02:14.956
The most important thing
is to identify the SMART demand.

00:02:14.996 --> 00:02:20.236
Smart as in S.M.A.R.T.

00:02:20.556 --> 00:02:25.116
Something that is specific,
measurable, achievable,

00:02:25.156 --> 00:02:27.476
relevant and time-bound.

00:02:27.796 --> 00:02:30.836
Something that you can
realistically achieve